cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalogue or the skill template, please cite it as below."
title: "Digital Methods Skills — executable research methodologies for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  A catalogue of executable research methodologies for AI agents, promoting methodological
  transparency, reproducibility and scientific attribution through documented, versioned and
  citable agent skills. Each package declares the research stage it serves, the credentials the
  operator must provide and what it explicitly does not do.
